# One-tree plan, phase 3: GpuPresenter's frames on the generated 2,000-node
# graph (index.html?nodes=2000&seed=7), beside p3_tree_2000's.
# Mark ruled the runner's debug build with short windows (2026-09-27): at
# 2,000 nodes it draws a frame every few seconds, so 30-frame windows and 60
# frames to settle, the same on both pages.
log phase 3: GpuPresenter on 2,000 generated nodes
timing start generated-startup
settle 30
timing stop
wait 30
capture p3_presenter_2000_startup
settle 60
timing start generated-steady
settle 30
timing stop
wait 30
capture p3_presenter_2000_steady
# The page lane ends as soon as its last step runs, so the final capture
# needs a wait to land before the report is written.
wait 30
